E_ALREADY_EXISTS	AlreadyExists	A resource with the same unique key already exists.	Choose a different name, or fetch the existing resource instead of creating a new one.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/mapping.go mapStateError (state.ErrConflict)
E_CONFLICT	FailedPrecondition	The operation conflicts with the resource's current state.	Resolve the state described in the message (cancel or wait for terminal states) and retry.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go DeleteApp (ADR-0023)
E_FORBIDDEN	PermissionDenied	The token lacks the scope required by this method.	Use a token whose role grants the required resource:action scope, or ask an admin for one.	internal/authn/interceptor.go guard (scopeSet.Satisfies)
E_INTERNAL	Internal	Internal server error.	Check fleetlyd logs for the matching error_id. If the error persists, report it with the error_id attached.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/mapping.go mapStateError (fallback)
E_INVALID_ARGUMENT	InvalidArgument	The request payload is invalid.	Fix the flagged field and retry. Field paths point at the exact input location.	internal/spec spec.ValidationError → internal/api/fleetlygrpc/mapping.go mapValidationError
E_INVALID_INVITATION	PermissionDenied	The invitation token is invalid, already used, or expired.	Ask an admin for a fresh invitation; invitation tokens are single-use and time-boxed.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/invitations.go AcceptInvitation
E_INVALID_SIGNATURE	Unauthenticated	The webhook signature verification failed.	Ensure the GitHub webhook secret matches the hook secret shown once by 'fleetly hooks set/rotate' (rotate the hook and update GitHub if the secret is lost).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/webhook.go ReceiveWebhook
E_NOT_CANCELLABLE	FailedPrecondition	The deployment has reached a terminal state and can no longer be cancelled.	Terminal states are facts, not actions; deploy a new revision instead.	internal/engine/admission.go Cancel
E_NOT_FOUND	NotFound	The requested resource does not exist.	Check the resource id and list existing resources to confirm the target.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/mapping.go mapStateError
E_NO_BASELINE	FailedPrecondition	The app has no successful deployment to roll back to.	Deploy at least one revision successfully before rolling back.	internal/engine/rollback.go Rollback
E_QUEUE_FULL	ResourceExhausted	The deployment admission queue is full for this app.	Retry after in-flight deployments finish, or cancel a queued deployment to free a slot.	internal/engine/admission.go Submit (ADR-0016)
E_QUOTA_EXCEEDED	ResourceExhausted	A project-level quota has been reached.	Remove unused entries of the quoted resource, or split the workload across projects.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go PutConfig (F0.17 quota)
E_SECRET_UNAVAILABLE	FailedPrecondition	The secret facility is unavailable or the referenced secret is missing.	Create the missing secret or restore the master key under the data root keys/ directory.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go PutSecret / resolveMaterials
E_UNAUTHENTICATED	Unauthenticated	The request carries no valid token.	Log in with a valid token ('fleetly login'), or check that the token has not been revoked.	internal/authn/interceptor.go guard
